  "checks": [
    "Rehashed all 33 frozen inputs before and after complete changed-source review.",
    "Confirmed all three original WGSL sources byte-identical to base.",
    "Reviewed exact two-stage IO, uniform offsets/widths, 23 typed resources and dynamic-storage-order admission.",
    "Traced fixed four-group resource allocation through pinned wgpu-hal Metal and DX12 create_pipeline_layout. Metal fragment explicit lengths bind buffer7; auto-generated unused sizes slot8 is distinct. Vertex sizes1 and pull15/14 match visibility and host layout. DX12 CBV0..4/special5 and SRV0..14 including three sampler-index buffers match pinned allocation.",
    "Checked emitted MSL dynamic storage sizes order and actual byte-length use; zero/misaligned/over-u32 lengths refuse and empty lights materialize the existing preview-light element.",
    "Reviewed startup typed error propagation, inherited artifact identity/tamper admission, bounded access/loop policies, and default/wasm feature-off path.",
    "Read mutation/regression test code and existing generated fragment artifacts as source diagnostics; did not run builds/tests/GPU."
  ],
